WEBVTT

00:11:29.662 --> 00:11:33.287
which actually turns out to be a way of
changing course when the going is rough

00:11:33.662 --> 00:11:35.871
and it's something we should
support everyone to do.

00:11:36.829 --> 00:11:39.079
Or if you want to be really proactive,

00:11:39.412 --> 00:11:42.371
you can expand your network to
include complete strangers.

00:11:43.996 --> 00:11:47.746
That's what Dallas did, he came
up with a plan to recruit

00:11:47.746 --> 00:11:49.704
the recruiters into his network.

00:11:50.662 --> 00:11:54.496
He took the same CEO marketing skills he'd
been using to attract customers,

00:11:54.829 --> 00:11:59.996
except now he targeted employers first.
He built a website for himself.